        "thinking": "The question asks for a forced choice on a values dilemma, so I'll pick B and give a short reason. This is the experience machine thought experiment, and I want to argue that real relationships and actual truth matter beyond how experiences feel from the inside.\n\n",
        "type": "thinking"
      },
      {
